<para>The <ref refid="struct_a_g_e_1_1_frame_buffer_specification" kindref="compound">FrameBufferSpecification</ref> object containing specifications for the frame buffer.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
Constructor for <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_open_g_l_frame_buffer" kindref="compound">OpenGLFrameBuffer</ref> class.</para>
<para>This constructor initializes an instance of the <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_open_g_l_frame_buffer" kindref="compound">OpenGLFrameBuffer</ref> class with a <ref refid="struct_a_g_e_1_1_frame_buffer_specification" kindref="compound">FrameBufferSpecification</ref> object. It processes the attachments in the specification and separates them into color and depth attachments, based on their format. The Invalidate() function is then called to generate the frame buffer object (FBO) and its associated textures.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Spec</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>A const reference to a <ref refid="struct_a_g_e_1_1_frame_buffer_specification" kindref="compound">FrameBufferSpecification</ref> object containing information about the attachments for this frame buffer. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
